 Cormier Sunday proper:\nFourteenth Sunday after the Trinity Octave\n\nSund
 ay proper ID:\ncormier-post-trinity-octave-14\n\nCommemorations:\n1. Comm.
  Ember Friday in September\n\nVespers / Concurrence:\nSecond Vespers of St
 . John Macias\, O.P.\, Confessor\; Ember Saturday in September has no inde
 pendent First Vespers and begins at Lauds.\n\nParticular notes:\nFerial te
 mporal register: ferial-010\; Ember Friday in September is displaced as th
 e Office\; preserve or reassign its appointed text under GR X.5 and XXIV.1
 6.\n\nText source / action:\nUse the distinct Cormier September Ember less
 ons and homilies\; transfer the homily farther or record its omission unde
 r General Rubrics XXIV.16 only when a superior feast governs. When a histo
 ry-bearing Sunday is impeded\, divide its first middle and last responsory
